    <visualElement><elementName>Text</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Description</string><string>P09 Branch comparator - Digital task
4-bit version: equality from XNOR gates, signed/unsigned less-than, then select by funct3.
Allowed parts: gates + Multiplexer, Demultiplexer, Decoder, PriorityEncoder
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="100" y="40"/></visualElement>
